    {
      "id": "legit-markdown",
      "md": "## Heading\n\nSome **bold**, some `code`, a [real link](https://example.com/page?a=1&b=2).\n\n- item one\n- item two\n\n> quoted\n\n```js\nconst a = 1;\n```\n\n| a | b |\n| - | - |\n| 1 | 2 |\n",
      "expect": {
        "hasTags": [
          "h2",
          "strong",
          "code",
          "a",
          "ul",
          "li",
          "blockquote",
          "pre",
          "table"
        ],
        "anchorsAllBlank": true,
        "textContains": "item two"
      }
    },
